  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Perfectly positioned in a sought-after Torbay location, this well-presented two-level home offers the ideal blend of style, comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, the home features three bedrooms plus a versatile study, two bathrooms, and bright open-plan living and dining areas flowing seamlessly to a sunny private deck - perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen offers quality appliances, ample storage and a practical layout, complemented by stylish bathrooms and quality finishes throughout. An internal-access garage and additional off-street parking add everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent school zoning, with Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College all in zone.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being close to Torbay Beach, Long Bay, local cafes, parks, shops and transport, while easy motorway access makes commuting around Auckland a breeze.\r\n\r\nVendor has already purchased - this property must be sold!\r\n\r\nDon't miss this fantastic opportunity to secure a quality home in one of Torbay's popular family-friendly locations.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
